.TH WERKMEISTER-PR-OPEN 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-pr\-open \- Gate, push and open each approved PR file
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister pr open\fR [repo]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-wait\fR
Don't wait for host load under budget.host_load before each check
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the result as JSON
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
